#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.expanding:1 of
msgid "Provide expanding window calculations within each group."
msgstr "提供每个组内的扩展窗口计算。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.expanding.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.expanding:3 of
msgid "Minimum observations in the window to produce a value."
msgstr "窗口中产生值所需的最小观测数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.expanding:5 of
msgid "Column(s) to aggregate. If None, all non-group-key columns."
msgstr "要聚合的列。如果为None，则为所有非分组键列。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.expanding.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.expanding:8 of
msgid "Intermediate object; call an aggregation method to produce a LiteFrame."
msgstr "中间对象；调用聚合方法来生成LiteFrame。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.expanding.rst
