#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.expanding:15 of
msgid ""
"Grouped transforms hash-shuffle rows by group key, so the output row "
"order follows reducer/hash-partition order and is **not** aligned with "
"the input frame. Row count is preserved."
msgstr ""
"分组转换通过分组键对行进行哈希重排，因此输出行顺序遵循reducer/哈希分区"
"顺序，并且与输入帧**不**对齐。行数得以保留。"

